Package: icecream-watcher
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: icecc
Description: terminal monitor for Icecream distributed compile clusters
 icecream-watcher shows an Icecream (icecc) build farm in the terminal, in
 the manner of btop: each build node reads like a process, with its load,
 running jobs and throughput.
 .
 It needs nothing installed on the build nodes; it opens one TCP connection
 to the scheduler, found by the same discovery rules icecc itself uses.
